                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To check, restrain, or control with, or as if with, a bridle; as in bridle your tongue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42dd96dc-6609-4845-a750-25dafdfac011",
                                                "sense_id": "6465a3b7-3a50-3ad0-9c00-192f6bfd00e9",
                                                "text": "Savoy and Nice, the keys of Italy, and the citadel in her hands to bridle Switzerland, are in that consolidation."
